%% GritSense - possession / rally phase state machine and EPV decision loop
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WaitingForBall
    WaitingForBall --> WaitingForBall: no visible ball
    WaitingForBall --> Serve: touch detected, server near baseline
    WaitingForBall --> Possession: ball seen on one side for 8 frames

    Serve --> InFlight: ball leaves the server
    Possession --> Pass: first touch, ball sent up from below 2.2 m
    Pass --> Set: second touch, ball sent up from above 2.2 m
    Set --> Attack: third touch, ball above 2.2 m and crosses the net
    Attack --> InFlight: ball crosses the net
    InFlight --> Pass: opponents' first touch
    InFlight --> Set: set detected
    InFlight --> Possession: side change debounced 8 frames
    Pass --> InFlight: ball travels to the chosen hitter
    Set --> InFlight: ball travels to the chosen hitter

    state Serve {
        [*] --> EPVFromBaseline
        EPVFromBaseline: EPV surface, serve shots only<br/>advice shown
    }
    state Set {
        [*] --> ChooseHitter
        ChooseHitter: evaluate each teammate's peak EPV<br/>recommend "set to #id"
    }
    state Attack {
        [*] --> EPVAtHit
        EPVAtHit: blockers judged at the hit<br/>3 nearest defenders, full reach
    }

    note right of Attack
        EPV = P(lands in) x (1 - P(blocked)) x P(no defender reaches)
        Smoothed over 0.18 EMA, debounced 10 frames,
        HRN priors weighted by measured test skill (currently 0.00)
    end note
